<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Service Unavailable · RaktSetu</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'><circle cx='16' cy='16' r='16' fill='%23C8232C'/><path d='M16 6c0 0-7 8.5-7 13a7 7 0 0014 0c0-4.5-7-13-7-13z' fill='white'/></svg>" />
</head>
<body class="bg-[#121212] font-sans antialiased text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6">
    <div class="w-full max-w-3xl bg-[#1A1A1A] rounded-[20px] p-12 md:p-16 text-center relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
        
        <div class="absolute top-6 left-8 text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#9CA3AF] flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/10">5XX</span>
            SERVICE UNAVAILABLE
        </div>

        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8232C]/10 border border-[#C8232C]/20 text-[#EF4444] text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-8">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EF4444] rs-pulse"></span>
            SERVICE DEGRADED · 503
        </div>
        
        <h1 class="font-bold tracking-tight mb-5 text-white" style="font-size: 36px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.2;">
            We're routing around the problem.
        </h1>
        
        <p class="text-[15px] text-[#9CA3AF] leading-relaxed max-w-lg mx-auto mb-10">
            RaktSetu can't reach its primary database right now. Critical request submissions are queued and will fire the moment we're back. For life-threatening situations, please call your nearest blood bank directly.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 mb-10">
            <a href="tel:104" class="rs-btn-primary h-12 px-6 rounded-[10px] font-semibold text-[14px] inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 w-full sm:w-auto justify-center transition-transform active:scale-95 shadow-lg shadow-red-500/20">
                <%- include('../partials/icon', { name: 'phone', size: 16 }) %>
                Call Help · 24/7
            </a>
            <a href="#" class="h-12 px-6 rounded-[10px] bg-[#262626] border border-[#404040] text-white font-semibold text-[14px] inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 w-full sm:w-auto justify-center hover:bg-[#333333] transition-colors active:scale-95">
                Status page
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 text-center text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-[#6B7280]">
            incident · INC-<%= Math.floor(Math.random() * 100000) %> · est. recovery 3 min
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
